# Utsuroi backend — server-side environment variables.
#
# These are NEVER committed and NEVER shipped in the app bundle. In production they
# live in the Vercel project's Environment Variables dashboard; for local development
# with `vercel dev`, copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in values.
#
# M2.3 (this milestone) needs NONE of these — the health check requires no config.
# They are documented here so the shape is clear; they get wired in M2.4 / M2.5:
#
#   AI_ACTIVE_PROVIDER=bluesminds
#
#   BLUESMINDS_API_KEY=
#   BLUESMINDS_BASE_URL=
#   BLUESMINDS_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
#
#   OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
#   OPENROUTER_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
#   OPENROUTER_MODEL=
#
#   # For verifying the caller's Supabase session on /api/generate:
#   SUPABASE_URL=
#   SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
